'''Cap'n Ahab''' (ホゲー, ''Hogē'') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 4.0 Update|Version 4.0]].

==Effect==
Cat Base Defense UP (Sm): Cat Base health is increased by 20%.

==Combo==
{{Combos
|{{CatCombo|Cap'n Ahab|Base Defense Up (Sm)|Fisherman Cat|Whale Cat|jpname=ホゲー}}
}}

==Trivia==
*This Cat Combo is a reference to ''[[wikipedia:Captain Ahab|Captain Ahab]]'', one of the main protagonists in [[wikipedia:Moby Dick|Moby Dick]], written by [[wikipedia:Herman Melville|Herman Melville]] in 1851, where Ahab dedicates most of his efforts hunting down the titular whale.

